,95,11],[29021,44.7,2020,81,93,10]],"links":[["Herkimer County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/new-york/herkimer-county"],["ARC or PLC in Herkimer County","/arc-plc/new-york/herkimer-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and April to May and May to June each came in under 90% of normal in 32 of them on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids. In 2025, August to September came in at 51% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, June to July sits at 79% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 27522 had its driest year in 1964 at 70% of normal.</p>"}
